00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:45.080
Like, the whole genre of the Indian Maverick cop.

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:45.920
I love it.

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:48.920
Like, India's version of superheroes like Captain America, you know?

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:50.120
Except he's like Captain India.

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:53.680
Oh, no.

00:09:53.680 --> 00:09:54.840
Is he wobbling it?

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:56.400
I think he wobbles this for a good, like, minute.

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:58.400
(fast forward noises)

00:09:58.400 --> 00:10:00.400
(RIP LAMPOST)

00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:02.720
Oh, god. Here we go.

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:05.280
(laughing) Is he gonna bonk 'em with a lightpost?

00:10:05.280 --> 00:10:07.140
He's ready to play some Beat Saber.

00:10:07.140 --> 00:10:09.060
Single arm Beat Saber (laughing) with a staff

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:09.920
There he goes!!

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:10.800
Oh, no.

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:11.560
Oh, no.

00:10:11.780 --> 00:10:12.760
*mimicking scene*

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:13.700
WHOAA

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:16.280
Done, dude.

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:17.300
Deceased.

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:20.560
(tires screeching)

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:21.220
(crash)

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:22.240
Whoa! (Holy crap.)

00:10:22.480 --> 00:10:23.300
Whoa!

00:10:23.300 --> 00:10:24.240
Hold up.

00:10:24.440 --> 00:10:25.120
Wait, what?

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:26.260
That was real!

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:27.160
That, like–

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:29.340
Those were not CG people.

00:10:29.340 --> 00:10:30.440
That was a real stunt there.

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:32.880
Obviously there had to have been wires that they painted out.

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:35.160
Oh! (Oh no.)

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:36.040
More wire work.

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:36.540
Pah!!

00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:37.440
The biggest–

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:38.140
Not but like he–

00:10:38.140 --> 00:10:39.160
got hit in the back of the head,

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:40.220
that causes him to fly up!

00:10:40.220 --> 00:10:41.080
(laughing)

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:45.960
Uh ohhhh!
(laughing)

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:47.020
He's like: "Whoaa!"

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:47.700
You can't–

00:10:47.700 --> 00:10:48.980
This dude just outran a car!

00:10:48.980 --> 00:10:50.100
You can't outrun this dude!

00:10:50.240 --> 00:10:51.320
Here comes a slap, dude.

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:52.320
Oh, it's a slap?

00:10:52.320 --> 00:10:53.780
Is this the power slap?

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:55.060
Oh, no!

00:10:55.060 --> 00:10:55.560
*slap*

00:10:55.560 --> 00:10:57.000
Ohohohoho
(laughing)

00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:58.520
(laughing)

00:10:58.520 --> 00:10:59.360
I love this.

00:11:00.780 --> 00:11:01.480
"Get back here!"

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:02.220
(*SNAP*)

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:04.460
(whooosh)

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:05.300
Yeah–

00:11:05.300 --> 00:11:07.279
That last shot looked really weird, by the way.

00:11:07.280 --> 00:11:08.020
The top-down one?

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:08.520
Yeah.

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:09.760
That– Something was up there.

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:10.899
Yeah, that's fake. Yeah.

00:11:10.899 --> 00:11:12.920
It's a perfect cut-out of him.

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:15.300
Is his shadow a little smaller than him?

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:16.800
It looks a little smaller, yeah.

00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:18.640
His shadow's always gonna be bigger.

00:11:18.640 --> 00:11:20.420
I'm fairly convinced now,

00:11:20.420 --> 00:11:22.959
they didn't actually shoot him spinning on that ground.

00:11:22.959 --> 00:11:26.169
They shot him somewhere else and they had to put him into that shot.

00:11:26.170 --> 00:11:28.100
So they probably just tracked the ground back in,

00:11:28.100 --> 00:11:29.529
rotoscoped him, turn that into a shadow

00:11:29.720 --> 00:11:32.760
Basically make him into a shadow on the ground, just slightly offset,

00:11:32.760 --> 00:11:33.670
and the effect's done.

00:11:33.900 --> 00:11:37.000
But they did a good job with the ambient occlusion. Look at the center of the shadow.

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:37.828
It gets darker.

00:11:37.828 --> 00:11:39.760
It works well enough for the moment,

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:42.500
It's over in, like, half a second and then you moved on.

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:44.220
You don't even remember that you saw that shot.

00:11:44.480 --> 00:11:45.580
Somebody gonna get a h–
Look at that–

00:11:45.580 --> 00:11:46.320
Oh, there we go.

00:11:46.320 --> 00:11:47.180
There we go!

00:11:47.300 --> 00:11:47.960
(laugh)

00:11:47.960 --> 00:11:49.220
Granny style.

